<title>JAPAN: Krosaki -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Krosaki -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 21.04		vs	   23.36</p>
<p> Operating   loss 450    million	  vs	prft 706 million</p>
<p> Current     loss 292    million	  vs	prft 442 million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 459    million	  vs	prft 406 million</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 7.03 yen	  vs     prft 6.21 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     65 million	  vs	  65 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Krosaki Corp is a large manufacturer of firebricks, mainly for steelmakers, and is affiliated with Nippon Steel Corp.</p>
